  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "fcrepo-vagrant was handy for bring up Fedora, CamelToolbox,solr, and fuseki for testing purposes.  We've moved towards docker with F6.  It would be handy to have a docker-compose script that brought up a similar fedora \"ecosystem\" with a single compose command.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
